{
  "title": "英文词频统计组件",
  "search_queries": [
    "python word frequency count regex ascii letters",
    "sort word frequency descending alphabetical python"
  ],
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "text": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "text"
    ],
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "output_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "frequencies": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "word": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "count": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "word",
            "count"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "frequencies"
    ],
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "assumptions": [
    "输入 payload 必须为字典且包含字符串键 text，否则组件行为未定义。",
    "单词定义为连续的一个或多个 ASCII 英文字母 [A-Za-z]+，匹配时统一转为小写。",
    "所有非 ASCII 英文字母的字符（包括数字、中文、撇号、连字符、下划线、空格、标点等）均视为分隔符。",
    "输出按 count 降序排列；count 相同时按 word 的字母顺序（Python 默认字符串比较）升序排列。",
    "空字符串或没有任何英文单词的文本返回空 frequencies 列表。",
    "输入文本不会被修改，组件仅返回新构建的结果字典。"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "仅支持纯 Python 标准库（re、collections 等），不依赖任何第三方库。",
    "不处理 Unicode 字母（如带重音字符、希腊字母、西里尔字母等），它们会被当作分隔符。",
    "不进行词形还原、停用词过滤或任何自然语言处理。",
    "不涉及网络、文件系统或外部服务，仅做内存中的纯文本转换。",
    "对于极大文本，内存占用与不同单词数量成正比，但未做流式优化。",
    "输出中的 word 均为小写 ASCII 字母字符串，count 为正整数。"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "input": {
        "text": "Hello, world! Hello everyone."
      },
      "expected": {
        "frequencies": [
          {
            "word": "hello",
            "count": 2
          },
          {
            "word": "everyone",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "world",
            "count": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "text": "apple banana apple cherry banana apple"
      },
      "expected": {
        "frequencies": [
          {
            "word": "apple",
            "count": 3
          },
          {
            "word": "banana",
            "count": 2
          },
          {
            "word": "cherry",
            "count": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "text": "Hello123world, test-case and under_score"
      },
      "expected": {
        "frequencies": [
          {
            "word": "and",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "case",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "hello",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "test",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "under",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "world",
            "count": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "text": "   "
      },
      "expected": {
        "frequencies": []
      }
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "text": "123 456 中文 日本語"
      },
      "expected": {
        "frequencies": []
      }
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "text": "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. The dog barks."
      },
      "expected": {
        "frequencies": [
          {
            "word": "the",
            "count": 3
          },
          {
            "word": "dog",
            "count": 2
          },
          {
            "word": "barks",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "brown",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "fox",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "jumps",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "lazy",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "over",
            "count": 1
          },
          {
            "word": "quick",
            "count": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}